{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a trial version of an officially authorized derivative RPG fan game created in accordance with lainTTL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world without God, you meet Lain again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A little in the future, in this world, the human race is largely divided into two groups: the old human race that lives in the real world, and the new human race that has abandoned the real world and lives in the Wired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, Lain receives an email and a file, and the story begins from there.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-10_185258.png?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/\u30a4\u30e9\u30b9\u30c827.jpg?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You become Lain Iwakura and explore the world of the Wired while interacting with an AI that records the people who were once involved with Lain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/2.jpg?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>operation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By writing a diary and reading emails, you will find the key to the mystery of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-03-21_193826.png?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also build your own world by customizing the NAVI, and the story will change by rearranging the files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trial version only allows you to play the first three stages.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3632190?t=1745480964","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/5c1b57029b342a164b74ddd508e04f862adeb763/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745480964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/7edee2d5d30d1de97317cfa15893c32674ad68fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745480964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/7edee2d5d30d1de97317cfa15893c32674ad68fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745480964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a trial version of an officially authorized derivative RPG fan game created in accordance with lainTTL.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a world without God, you meet Lain again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A little in the future, in this world, the human race is largely divided into two groups: the old human race that lives in the real world, and the new human race that has abandoned the real world and lives in the Wired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One day, Lain receives an email and a file, and the story begins from there.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-04-10_185258.png?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/\u30a4\u30e9\u30b9\u30c827.jpg?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You become Lain Iwakura and explore the world of the Wired while interacting with an AI that records the people who were once involved with Lain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/2.jpg?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>operation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By writing a diary and reading emails, you will find the key to the mystery of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-03-21_193826.png?t=1745480964\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also build your own world by customizing the NAVI, and the story will change by rearranging the files.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The trial version only allows you to play the first three stages.</p>","developers":["team_MJM"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3632010","name":"//signal."},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3632190/7ad2b21721535036531e39fadcc39f3e41e68f6e/header.jpg?t=1745480964","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> mac OS X<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.6GHz Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX9<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 700 MB available spac